homebridge-nobis

Development scaffold adapted from homebridge/homebridge-plugin-template,
revision ab217b1ff36fbbf69931822324e1986113cd9d81 (Apache License 2.0).
https://github.com/homebridge/homebridge-plugin-template

Changes: Nobis Dynamic Platform registration, configuration GUI and validation,
independent Agua-IoT client, opt-in cloud readings and supervised controls,
standard HomeKit accessories, private pending-command state, local diagnostics,
user and API documentation, and automated tests. Example template accessories
and custom services are not used.
